  "narration": "On this slide, we're talking about how our system has reached a certain level of readiness, called TRL 4+. Think of TRL 4+ as a way to say, 'Hey, we've tested this in controlled labs and simulated real-world situations to make sure it works well.' This is important because it means our system is ready to be used in real life.

Now, the final part of our conclusion is about how our system can keep people safe. By controlling who can enter and exit, and by reducing risks, we can make places safer. But this is just the beginning. We want to keep improving it, making sure it fits the needs of different places like malls and hubs. It's like when you're learning something new; you start simple, then you keep making it better over time."
